        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louis \"Louie\" Zamperini\n- Works: Unbroken (film)\n- Roles: Olympian, army officer, prisoner of war survivor, Christian evangelist, Olympic distance runner\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- Louis \"Louie\" Zamperini was born on January 26, 1917.\n- Louis \"Louie\" Zamperini was an Olympic distance runner.\n- During World War II, Louis \"Louie\" Zamperini was a US prisoner of war survivor.\n- Louis \"Louie\" Zamperini was also an army officer and a Christian evangelist.\n- The film Unbroken revolves around the life of USA Olympian and army officer Louis \"Louie\" Zamperini.\n- Louis \"Louie\" Zamperini died on July 2, 2014.",
